                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                ( Search order ________________________________________________ 10/10/26 BNE )                                                  : definitions ( -- )        context @ current ! ;                               \ compile into the first context wordlist       : contexts  ( -- n )        0 context begin @+ 128 and 0=                       \ number of wordlists in the search order                                   while swap 1+ swap repeat drop ;                                                                    : previous  ( -- )          contexts 1parm >r context dup slice+                \ drop the first wordlist of the search order                               swap r> cmove ;                                                                                     : also      ( -- )          context dup slice+  contexts 1+ cmove>              \ duplicate top of context stack                                            255  [ context |context| chars+ ] literal  ! ;      \ backstop the terminator                       : vocabulary ( <name> -- )  _text align create wordlist , does> @ context ! ;   \ create a new vocabulary                       : _contexts ( -- )          context contexts 2parms for @+ .wid next drop ;     \ list contexts with first on the left          : order     ( -- )          ." Context: " _contexts cr                          \ list the search order                                                     ." Current: " current @ .wid ;                                                                                                                                                                                                      -->                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             ( Block support _______________________________________________ 10/9/26 BNE )                                                   : thru      ( u1 u2 -- )    over - 1+ 2parms  for dup load 1+ next drop ;       \ load a sequence of blocks                     -->                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             